4. Continuous-time BFN on Continuous Data
This section bridges BFNs on continuous data with DMs by establishing a linear SDE for noise modeling in BFN (Sec. 4.1), aligning training objectives with DSM (Sec. 4.2), and validating the sampler as discretization of the reversetime SDE (Sec. 4.3). Further, fast samplers are developed based on the recipe in DMs in Sec. 4.4.

